function routeDef(side,dir,p){p=+p;const valid=(side==='W'&&dir==='in'?p===1:side==='E'&&dir==='out'?p===1:p===1||p===2),origin=dir==='in'?side+'I':'P'+p,target=dir==='in'?'P'+p:side+'O',req={[side==='W'?'11':'21']:p===2?1:0};if(p===1){if(side==='W')req['31']=1;else req['32']=1;if(dir==='in')req[side==='W'?'32':'31']=0;}else req['33']=dir==='in'?0:1;return{id:side+'-'+dir+'-'+p,side,dir,p,valid,origin,target,req,paths:[origin,side+p,target],resources:[side+'T'],cross:false};}
